Some relevant nodes from README on local PC:

## ----- Apptainer instructions (also see in ~/Projects/GSI/WDL/efficient_dv) -------------------------------------//

# Need to run these commands on internet-connected node:

 module load apptainer/1.4.5
 apptainer pull docker://ubuntu:22.04

# The command above should produce ubuntu_22.04.sif

 apptainer exec ubuntu_22.04.sif echo "Hello from container"
